WEBVTT

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.950
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.300
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.100
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:20.301 --> 00:00:22.601
她：（不挣开）我是楼上宴会的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
Her: (Doesn't pull away.) I'm the photographer for the party upstairs. What's wrong with your eyes?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 1 轮 · Realtime round 1）

00:00:25.229 --> 00:00:27.557
眼睛？那是你害的。
The eyes? That's your doing.

00:00:27.757 --> 00:00:30.069
Harland把订婚提前了，还有十分钟。
Harland moved the engagement up. Ten minutes.

00:00:30.269 --> 00:00:32.581
关掉车库监控，谁也别下来。
Kill the garage cameras. Nobody comes down.

00:00:35.293 --> 00:00:37.605
待着。
Stay.

00:00:37.905 --> 00:00:40.205
她：什么叫我害的？你把话说清楚。
Her: What do you mean, I caused this? Explain yourself.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 2 轮 · Realtime round 2）

00:00:40.305 --> 00:00:45.161
自从我闻到你的气味，它们就不肯变回来了。
Since I caught your scent, they won't stay human.

00:00:45.361 --> 00:00:47.673
原来你在这里。
There you are.

00:00:47.873 --> 00:00:50.185
Mate。这就是你对我的意义。
Mate. That's what you are to me.

00:00:50.385 --> 00:00:52.697
先生……您的眼睛。
Sir… your eyes.

00:00:52.897 --> 00:00:55.209
封锁监控。查清她是谁。
Seal the cameras. Find out who she is.

00:00:55.509 --> 00:00:57.809
她：Mate是什么意思？你先说清楚再碰我。
Her: What does Mate mean? Explain it clearly before you touch me.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 3 轮 · Realtime round 3）

00:00:57.909 --> 00:01:02.765
Mate。是为我而生的那一头狼。
Mate. The one wolf made for me.

00:01:02.965 --> 00:01:04.775
跟我走。剩下的路上我告诉你。
Come with me. I'll tell you the rest.

00:01:06.984 --> 00:01:08.794
开车。
Drive.

00:01:11.003 --> 00:01:12.813
现在我身上全是你的气味。
Your scent is on me now.

00:01:13.113 --> 00:01:15.413
她：上车，坐到另一侧
Her: Get in the car and sit on the other side.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 4 轮 · Realtime round 4）

00:01:15.513 --> 00:01:20.369
你待在你那边。我在努力克制。
Stay on your side. I'm trying.

00:01:23.081 --> 00:01:25.393
今晚不接。
Not tonight.

00:01:25.593 --> 00:01:27.905
现在，他们会来找你了。
They'll come looking for you now.

00:01:28.105 --> 00:01:30.417
让他们来。
Let them.

00:01:30.717 --> 00:01:33.017
她：谁会来找我？还有，刚才那是谁的电话？
Her: Who's coming for me? And whose call was that just now?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 5 轮 · Realtime round 5）

00:01:33.117 --> 00:01:35.445
Selene。我的未婚妻。我挂了她的电话。
Selene. My fiancée. I hung up on her.

00:01:38.173 --> 00:01:39.983
她的人。长老会。他们不会问第二遍。
Her people. The elders. They won't ask twice.

00:01:44.202 --> 00:01:46.011
欢迎来到我的领地。在这里没人能碰你。
Welcome to my territory. No one touches you here.

00:01:48.321 --> 00:01:50.621
她：不是人类？那你是什么？说清楚。
Her: Not human? Then what are you? Explain it clearly.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 6 轮 · Realtime round 6）

00:01:50.721 --> 00:01:55.577
不是人类。不完全是。
Not human. Not entirely.

00:01:57.787 --> 00:01:59.596
我是狼。这就是它的意思。
I'm a wolf. This is what that means.

00:02:01.806 --> 00:02:03.615
闻到你气味的那一刻，我就走了订婚。
I walked out on the engagement the moment I caught your scent.

00:02:03.815 --> 00:02:05.625
你在发抖。
You're shaking.

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:08.225
她：握住他的手：我没在怕
Her: Takes his hand: I'm not afraid.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 7 轮 · Realtime round 7）

00:02:15.893 --> 00:02:18.205
那你为什么在发抖？
Then why are you shaking?

00:02:18.405 --> 00:02:20.717
Arkwright小姐，他今晚不见任何人。
Miss Arkwright, he's not receiving anyone.

00:02:20.917 --> 00:02:23.229
待在我身后。
Stay behind me.

00:02:23.529 --> 00:02:25.829
她：外面是谁？我倒要看看她到底是谁。
Her: Who's outside? I want to see who she really is.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 8 轮 · Realtime round 8）

00:02:25.929 --> 00:02:30.785
待在我身后。你会看到她。
Stay behind me. You'll see her.

00:02:30.985 --> 00:02:33.297
原来是真的。
So it's true.

00:02:33.497 --> 00:02:35.809
她轮不到你过问，Selene。
She is not your concern, Selene.

00:02:36.009 --> 00:02:38.321
一个人类，Magnus？满月之前，长老会会把她带走。
A human, Magnus? The Council will have her before the full moon.

00:02:41.133 --> 00:02:43.433
她：满月前带走我？你先说清楚，长老会凭什么。
Her: Take me before the full moon? Explain it clearly. What gives the Elders the right?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 9 轮 · Realtime round 9）

00:02:43.533 --> 00:02:45.861
族规赋予他们权利。老规矩，人类的血不属于这里。
The law gives them the right. Old law. Human blood doesn't belong.

00:02:53.613 --> 00:02:55.925
我不会让他们碰你。
I won't let them touch you.

00:02:58.737 --> 00:03:01.037
她：我不想逃，我想留下
Her: I don't want to run. I want to stay.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 10 轮 · Realtime round 10）

00:03:01.137 --> 00:03:03.465
再说一遍。
Say it again.

00:03:13.729 --> 00:03:16.041
今晚留下来陪我。
Stay with me tonight.

00:03:16.341 --> 00:03:18.641
她：留下可以，先陪我去天台吹吹风。
Her: You can stay, but first come with me to the rooftop for some fresh air.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 11 轮 · Realtime round 11）

00:03:18.741 --> 00:03:23.597
好。先吹风。
Fine. Wind first.

00:03:27.816 --> 00:03:29.626
你要透气，那就呼吸。
You wanted air. Breathe.

00:03:31.835 --> 00:03:33.645
那不是欢迎。
That's not a welcome.

00:03:33.945 --> 00:03:36.245
她：Harland是谁？长老会要对我们做什么？
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 12 轮 · Realtime round 12）

00:03:36.345 --> 00:03:38.673
Harland。长老会的首席，守着旧族规。
Harland. The eldest of the Council. He keeps the old law.

00:03:38.873 --> 00:03:41.201
他要你今晚被交出去。
He wants you handed over. Tonight.

00:03:43.913 --> 00:03:46.225
Alpha，Harland召集了长老，他们今晚要人。
Alpha. Harland has called the elders. They want her tonight.

00:03:46.425 --> 00:03:48.737
那就让他们当面听我的答复。
Then they'll hear my answer in person.
